# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The .env.docker rule below was previously commented out, so the file was
# committed in c2309c7 carrying a live Supabase service-role key (which bypasses
# row-level security) plus five LLM provider keys. Untracking it does NOT undo
# that exposure — those credentials remain in git history and must be rotated.
.env
.env.local
# .env.docker
.env.*.local
*.env.docker
.DS_Store

# ── Local docs and PDFs — kept out of the repo ───────────────────────────────
docs/
*.pdf

# ── Generated artefacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Knowledge-graph output: ~15 MB of caches and exports, fully reproducible from
# the source tree, so it is regenerated rather than versioned.
graphify-out/

# Local agent tooling — installed per-developer, not part of the application.
.agents/

# Playwright run output (traces, screenshots, last-run state).
apps/VanikaAi-Frontend/test-results/
apps/VanikaAi-Frontend/playwright-report/
apps/VanikaAi-Frontend/e2e-results.json

# Claude Code tooling artifacts
skills-lock.json

# Stray model/config dumps that land in the working tree; not project files
claude-*.md

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Demo test coverage
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
.venv/
.scannerwork/
